U   U1  in      n1

R   R   in      gnd
C   C   gnd     n1

/* Bad Bode plot result: We reference the output voltage by implicit name, U_ followed by
   the name of a node, but the node is the ground node, which is not element of the
   calculation. It is the reference point for all other nodes and implicitly has the
   voltage zero. */
PLOT G U_gnd U1

/* Bad full result: U1 is not a dependent quentity but an independent, given system input. */
RES R U1
